[node name="InviteUnavailableDialog" type="AcceptDialog" parent="." unique_id=838242698]
title = "Join from another ScenSyn instance"
ok_button_text = "Understood"
dialog_text = "Local multi-instance Workshop sessions use the start-screen Multiplayer checkbox.

1. First instance: create or select a Scenario, enable Multiplayer, start (hosts on 127.0.0.1:28960).
2. Later instances: enable Multiplayer and confirm — no need to recreate the Scenario; the host sends it.
3. In-session, each peer enters a display name. Facilitator is claim-until-taken; the Facilitator-needed dialog closes once someone claims (or when you join after a claim exists).

Email invitations and remote Hub sync are not implemented. Nothing outbound was sent."

